{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"b2f2dd93f68321a982eb6013a6daf107a514cb68e6a8d85f17dc3a3d57910ba7","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"b604eb5dfbae84adab614890c32df489b2d95703614015339b00d73961c7147d","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"b8714935ab7d4a29eaf4af3ed62dceec402d2a5769c1a4b767ce37c7749e84b5","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"b95bbbc8a48f6847804a1c2642456a8e4d851a98bd6c3419ec9b186716e66ed3","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"b9eb8a819af63ac8a5d5dfef4d53fa5a8bde6e1ebf1a8d659bf27a38f8681c81","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"ba8b49f05737947ea944f2dbfdd532170ecf0522489e0a65a4a12c91771160b1","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"baeacde95a44c91db9690ca9e2f86d2d2617435a67e3bdccc0d938e875251b95","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"tome-cults/data/lore/kroshkkur.lua:83-85 (source unpinned) refers to Ralkur as \"it\" throughout. The translation uses 他 for Ralkur in paragraph 1 (他以通晓…、他会向…) but switches to 它 in paragraph 2 (它感到了恐惧、叫它离开、追捕它), so the same god gets two different pronouns within one entry. Also, \"Since no one can enter this dungeon without leaving\" is rendered as 没有人到达过这座地下城的底层, which changes the stated premise."},{"revision_key":"bb57dc02d85e7e06b9afd3c6af1eea5ffae3f92501e228a85c4df7af98038904","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"bf27868c920e8fcf602071d3f631a34696b1d3a5ab716fdcdce3726735ddaf6a","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"bf6f268df4c79931d7704139ac53a1d2ec54462e9a044d62a725ad3a9fd7dfe8","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"c09141f295e58bc19c1c5be435e14268290d8dbd138db5ecab06ebc104fdb81c","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"c1ebee2aae2872bb6bd524028c759112851c8f3f6b4e3cf293ed1cfca3251ce7","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"c26a569f0cc91945633cef750cdc009030a1115f09361ad0555aa6355553c271","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"tome-cults/data/timed_effects.lua:230 (source unpinned): this is the on_gain message of a detrimental timed effect (+Out of sight), and the source says direct control \"will break\", i.e. it has not broken yet. The target 直接控制中断了！ says